              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ea siida abaloola fuga Israeli nea giyeeshi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ghweanigeagwa niing'eawean aba ng'asheanji aba gideaba niidiiy aba badaydeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghaayaachi ng'eanyiita ghayi eayeaksi habeawooda gideaba gaydaadawiin, hean iisidaah heayeeda geaw ghana geeta mideawa seenga saang'a, hean geatayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda ea lukghumajeega nyaawa nea geesajan nea aba hoowa geatayda lukghumajeega ng'andidi shearu, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sileeha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaanyaashchi saawa gideaba, hooweani sigadoowani oobadiinayiin geeguuraan? Asi gheawungaaschi ea ghoah ghamneawa geeguura Bama",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bama: Gideabeadaanyi heetiyeada gil.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi eeshiina fuga Israeli gideaba, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, heapi? Ghoang'udi geat ririnnyeanda aba gideaba ghoayaachi naweeda ghweanigeagwa? Gooweayi asina hiseadayeanduumeeda aba gideaba ghoayaachi geeshta ng'asheega nyaawa munyasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iyoataydi haleanjeedeang'wa bea guskuseega ea lukghumajeega, nea goosiikchi diibigeagwa jeeda beasta, heapi goong'udi geat ririnnyeanda aba sanaamajeegeagwa sean ea ghoah ghamneawa? Ak aniini gajoonyaashaan ng'asheanda. Ea fuga Israeli, aba gideabideati gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, majoanyaashaan ng'asheanda agooga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suh oomanyayi aba gurooruunatkeagwean, maygwasa earahay–gooyeenyi, ‘gajeewuurjeewana eemoojiga suurja, eemoojiga darooraka suurja, ak geabwachi geediga ea lagheanga.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA ghwala uhuuda nea gwasamsa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideabideati gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba huumwa aba geatinda mideawa uurda gaydeambaleegwa aba nyarasta jea goobisseegwa gaydoaw sugoocheandeang'wa jea goombaleegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydearuuna jeeda eemoojiga, ak ghaabwadi geat ak gaydearuuna jeeda darooraka oodardeaysi jeeda aba geatinda mideawa uurda, ea geatinda ng'waan ea nyarasta abiseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang'ata gaydaadeagwa jeeda dareapcheeda buuneeda. Abeeda aba hoowa gaydeargweakseegwa nea geeng'ulayi geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideargweaksiindi ghweanigeagwa aba dareapcheeda Misri, ea gichea deargweaksiindaneegwa gil gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaygaba nih aahaaghwi aba uurda, nea ghaanung' amwasa neajeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydageanda fuga heawanaan aba bugusteang'wa. Ea giika adiiyseaniin gaydearuuteawa ng'eanyiida mida was rabasta, ak ea maygaweay ng'eanyiida fuga Israeli, ak gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea aba iita ng'asheegeagwa, Ea fuga Israeli, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, “Aweayeena aghadoawana sanaamajeegeagwa eara iidu, iimoogasi ooleeysean iit, nea gheawungeasu ghaydit ea maygudu ang'udana ririnnyeanda aba haleanjeedeang'wa bea guskuseega ea sanaamajeegeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba uhuuda giijeedeanyu ghaydit, uhuuda giijeeda geaw muuchi bea Israeli, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA abeeda gaygagadiyeesean fuga sean bea Israeli sean bea ng'eanyiita, ak gaydadeaptaneegwa aba hoowa. Nea aba hoowa gaydagasa haleanjeedeang'wa sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda, ea haleanjeedeang'wa sean ghaydidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyearuunaneegwa ng'eanyiida ghayi oodardeaysi, ak ghaabwadaneegwa geat; abeeda gaydaang'waay haleanjeedeang'wa oasabi geat ng'andit bea ghadooweeda, ak gaydaahiimu ghaydidandeanyu aba heedeang'wa nea madeeda eemoojiga suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, iyeanung' aweayeena jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli. Ng'eanyiida ghayi aayaaji habeawooda gideaba gaydaadaw ghweanigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba hoowa gajoopkaada naweadingeagwa, ea gadiyoojigeagwa sean, ghayi oang'udi geat ririnnyeanda. Ak gajasta geat agooga nea goobea geat, aba ng'asheegeagwa munyas oosinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, inyas geasinyi sea agooga aba gheawungeasu nea mawuurji naweadingeagwa munyas, nea mawuurji sinaweegeagwa munyas, Ea fuga Israeli gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beasta mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, yamwa geaw gala wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ak girukwiidi ng'asheega aba wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara. Nea giramoorsi dareabeeta ng'eanyiida Negebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giyeeshi dareabeeta Negebu, Aleeysiiniit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA: Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula gaydaayeat beasta aba jeadaang'u, ak gayghwaak gilinyoo ea geeta shabwaat gil aba jeadaang'u, ea gilinyoo ea geeta ghajaam gil, ak ng'ushapteaba beastida ea maygamis, ak gheamamuunatka sean gayghwaak beasta ghang'eada wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara ea gagul wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa gayghwaak Boasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwadaah buuneesean gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA, naayeachi ak ea maygamis.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geayeenyi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA! Saawa inyeessa gabaloola badaydeanyu nea gwayi, ‘Heapi siisi mii siida sarmani ghwasiildeangea?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
